{"vid":"o7a68z9jNjA","source":"o7a68z9jNjA.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"4 to 20 milliamps is still one of the"},{"t":2.1,"txt":"most common signal types you'll find in"},{"t":3.9,"txt":"control systems today."},{"t":5.8,"txt":"It's typically used to connect field"},{"t":7.6,"txt":"instruments like pressure transmitters"},{"t":10.1,"txt":"back to an input device like a PLC."},{"t":13.2,"txt":"It's an analog signal where the current"},{"t":15.6,"txt":"represents a value from 0 to 100%."},{"t":18.9,"txt":"So, let's look at simple example."},{"t":21.8,"txt":"Here, we've got a pressure transmitter"},{"t":23.7,"txt":"measuring 0 to 10 PSI"},{"t":26.1,"txt":"wired back to a PLC input card with just"},{"t":29.1,"txt":"two wires."},{"t":30.7,"txt":"The PLC provides the voltage to power"},{"t":33.2,"txt":"the transmitter and current loop."},{"t":36.1,"txt":"The transmitter then controls the"},{"t":38.1,"txt":"current in the loop by changing its own"},{"t":40.4,"txt":"internal resistance."},{"t":42.4,"txt":"At 0 PSI, it outputs 4 milliamps."},{"t":46.1,"txt":"At 10 PSI, it outputs 20 milliamps."},{"t":49.9,"txt":"And everything in between is scaled"},{"t":52,"txt":"proportionally."},{"t":53.8,"txt":"So, why do we still find and use 4 to 20"},{"t":56.6,"txt":"milliamps in industry today?"},{"t":59.8,"txt":"First, it's very robust. You can run it"},{"t":62.8,"txt":"over hundreds of meters of cable without"},{"t":65.1,"txt":"issues."},{"t":66.4,"txt":"It's not affected by a small changes in"},{"t":68.6,"txt":"resistance."},{"t":70,"txt":"The current stays stable around the"},{"t":71.6,"txt":"loop."},{"t":73.3,"txt":"It's easy to fault find. You can"},{"t":75.6,"txt":"diagnose most issues with just a"},{"t":77.8,"txt":"multimeter."},{"t":79.8,"txt":"With 4 milliamps being the zero, if you"},{"t":82.7,"txt":"have a problem in our loop or lose"},{"t":84.7,"txt":"power, our signal will go out of range"},{"t":87.6,"txt":"and read minus 25% at 0 milliamps."},{"t":91.6,"txt":"And finally, you can still run digital"},{"t":93.9,"txt":"communication like HART over the top of"},{"t":96.9,"txt":"the signal."},{"t":101.8,"txt":"In the example we looked at before, we"},{"t":104,"txt":"used a two-wire transmitter"},{"t":106.5,"txt":"where the PLC powers the device."},{"t":109.3,"txt":"But, you'll also come across four-wire"},{"t":111.4,"txt":"transmitters."},{"t":112.9,"txt":"Two wires are used for standalone power"},{"t":115.7,"txt":"to supply the instrument."},{"t":118,"txt":"The other two wires are then used to"},{"t":119.8,"txt":"output a 4 to 20 milliamp signal back to"},{"t":122.6,"txt":"the PLC separately. That simplicity and"},{"t":125.4,"txt":"reliability is exactly why 4 to 20"},{"t":127.9,"txt":"milliamps is still used everywhere in"},{"t":130.1,"txt":"industry."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"4"},{"t":0.44,"w":"to"},{"t":0.56,"w":"20"},{"t":0.8,"w":"milliamps"},{"t":1.28,"w":"is"},{"t":1.48,"w":"still"},{"t":1.84,"w":"one"},{"t":2,"w":"of"},{"t":2.04,"w":"the"},{"t":2.12,"w":"most"},{"t":2.4,"w":"common"},{"t":2.72,"w":"signal"},{"t":3.04,"w":"types"},{"t":3.4,"w":"you'll"},{"t":3.52,"w":"find"},{"t":3.8,"w":"in"},{"t":3.92,"w":"control"},{"t":4.32,"w":"systems"},{"t":4.72,"w":"today."},{"t":5.76,"w":"It's"},{"t":5.96,"w":"typically"},{"t":6.44,"w":"used"},{"t":6.84,"w":"to"},{"t":6.96,"w":"connect"},{"t":7.28,"w":"field"},{"t":7.56,"w":"instruments"},{"t":8.4,"w":"like"},{"t":8.64,"w":"pressure"},{"t":8.92,"w":"transmitters"},{"t":10.08,"w":"back"},{"t":10.32,"w":"to"},{"t":10.4,"w":"an"},{"t":10.52,"w":"input"},{"t":10.8,"w":"device"},{"t":11.48,"w":"like"},{"t":11.72,"w":"a"},{"t":11.76,"w":"PLC."},{"t":13.24,"w":"It's"},{"t":13.48,"w":"an"},{"t":13.64,"w":"analog"},{"t":14,"w":"signal"},{"t":14.6,"w":"where"},{"t":14.72,"w":"the"},{"t":14.84,"w":"current"},{"t":15.56,"w":"represents"},{"t":16.04,"w":"a"},{"t":16.08,"w":"value"},{"t":16.6,"w":"from"},{"t":16.84,"w":"0"},{"t":17.08,"w":"to"},{"t":17.2,"w":"100%."},{"t":18.92,"w":